hey do believe it, and we've already proved it. And this is what the Hadith is talking about. That's why the same Hadith -which you didn't fully quote-: the next thing after saying that they say they worship Ezra as the son of God, the Hadith states that Allah did not take a son. So that's the issue here. That's the claim. It is claiming that 'Uzair or Ezra is the son of God.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Atheist Disproves The Quran?! Is Ezra The Son Of God? Islam Predates Judaism|”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_RrmYKq0qU", ((1500, "25:00–25:42"), (1564, "26:04–26:46"), (1608, "26:48–27:42"), (1677, "27:57–28:28"), (1711, "28:31–29:22"), (1766, "29:26–30:18"), (1820, "30:20–30:38"), (1843, "30:43–31:39"), (1901, "31:41–31:58"), (1964, "32:44–33:51"), (2036, "33:56–34:22"),))
